						"variant"
					],
					"deprecated": "old form: the view"
				}
			},
			"description": "A character reference in a VN event (joinScene / leaveScene), as authored: `{ character, persona, look?, mood?, variant? }` (`variant` = the view). The old form `{ name, position: { variant } }` and old character ids (plf, cat, mountain-tiger → catpope personas) still resolve (`normalizeSceneRef` in characters.ts). The same character may be in a scene with several personas (Cat Pope meets Cat Pope · Biker)."
		},
